OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize customised bike
OL,4,A'capable of 28 mph'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "If your bicycle
OL,7,Fhas more wiring than the average police
OL,8,Fcar and does nearly 30mph, it might be
OL,9,Fworth checking the law before taking it
OL,10,Ffor a spin."
